    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Buɔ̱n bööthni palä",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu nɛmɛ a buɔ̱n gan Ä-ron. Cu gaat Ä-ron a Na-dab kɛnɛ Ä-bi-ɣu kɛ Ɛl-a-dhar kɛnɛ I-ta-mar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö cu Na-dab kɛnɛ Ä-bi-ɣu kɔŋ li̱w nikɛn kä gua̱ndiɛn, kä thilɛ kɛ gaat. Kä cu Ɛl-a-dhar kɛnɛ I-ta-mar a bööth palä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua kɛ luäk ɛ Dha-dok gat Ɛl-a-dhar kɛnɛ Ä-ɣi-mɛ-lɛk gat I-ta-mar, kä cu Dee-bid kɛ la̱th bua̱a̱ni ce̱tnikɛ lätkiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cua gaat Ɛl-a-dhar la̱th buɔ̱a̱ni da̱ŋ wäl bäkɛl, kä cua gaat I-ta-mar la̱th bua̱a̱ni da̱ŋ bädäk, kɛ ɣöö cu ŋuan ni bööth thuk duëli Ɛl-a-dhar kä bööth thuk duëli I-ta-mar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua kɛ da̱a̱k kɛ yor gaakni a päär, kɛ ɣöö tëë kɛ bööth luaak Kuɔth kɛ bööth palä Kuɔth rɛy gan Ɛl-a-dhar kɛnɛ I-ta-mar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Cɛ-mɛ̈-yaa gat Nɛ-tan-el bulkamiin raan Lii-bay kɛ gɔ̱a̱r piny nhiam kua̱r, kɛnɛ bööth, kɛ bööth palä ni Dha-dok kɛnɛ Ä-ɣi-mɛ-lɛk gat Ɛb-ya-thar, kɛ bööth thuk duëli bööthni pali kɛ ji̱ Lii-bay. Cua thok duëël kɛl ka̱n thok duëël Ɛl-a-dhar kɛnɛ thok duëël I-ta-mar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu nɔmɔ a jɛn kuëny ëë kuanykɛ kɛ, kɛ kui̱ latnikiɛn rɛy luaak Kuɔth Nhial, ce̱tnikɛ mëë ca la̱rkɛ ɛ gua̱ndɔɔŋdiɛn ni Ä-ron, ce̱tnikɛ mëë ca la̱r jɛ ɛ Kuoth Nhial min la Kuoth I-thɛ-rɛl.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ji̱ Lii-bay tin kɔ̱ŋ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu tɔ̱tɔ̱ a ji̱ Lii-bay kɛ thuk duëlikiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kɛ gaakni yuɔr ce̱tnikɛ mëë ca la̱t ɛ gaat mani ni gaat Ä-ron nhiam kua̱r ni Dee-bid kɛnɛ Dha-dok kɛ Ä-ɣi-mɛ-lɛk kɛ bööth thuk duëli bööthni pali kɛ ji̱ Lii-bay. Cukɛ jɛ la̱t kɛn diaal bööth thuk duëli kɛɛl kɛ gaat mani tin tiɛtni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
